---
description: Reproducibility rules for experiments
globs:
  - "src/**/experiments/**/*.py"
  - "configs/**/*"
  - "scripts/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Experiment behavior must come from validated configuration.
- Save the seed, configuration, mechanism parameters, code revision, and environment.
- Preserve failed trials and failure reasons.
- Trial-level output must remain tidy and machine readable.
- Never overwrite an existing completed run.
- Analysis code must not mutate raw results.